### ============================================================
### StartTooler LAN Upload Server — HTTP Routes (v0.14)
###
### 可直接用 JetBrains HTTP Client / VS Code REST Client 打开。
###
### 变量:
###   @host   局域网服务地址(启动 UploadServerViewModel 后看 UI 显示)
###   @port   端口(随机空闲端口,默认扫描后取第一个)
###   @secret 32 位 hex secret(UI 显示,可从 /api/v1/health 拿到)
###   @project 项目名(RecentDirectories 中的目录名),上传前改成你自己的
###
### 用法:
###   1) 先跑一次 1.health 拿 secret
###   2) 把 secret 填到 @secret(或者直接用变量形式 {{health.response.body.$.secret}})
###   3) 修改 @host/@port/@project 后,点击各请求左侧 ▶ 运行
### ============================================================

@host = 127.0.0.1
@port = 8080
@secret = replace_me_with_32_char_hex
@project = my-project

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 1) Health check(无鉴权,返回 secret + currentProject)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/health

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 2) List projects(受保护)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/projects?k={{secret}}

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 3) Upload to project(受保护,multipart)
###    @file 路径指向本地要上传的图片/视频
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/projects/{{project}}/upload?k={{secret}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 4) H5 upload page(浏览器打开,无鉴权)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/upload

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 5) H5 legacy upload(无鉴权,沿用 v0.10 行为)
### ----------------------------------------------------------
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### ----------------------------------------------------------
### 6) Negative cases(用于验证 401 / 405 / 404)
### ----------------------------------------------------------

### 6.1 错误 secret → 401
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/projects?k=wrong_secret

### 6.2 通过 X-Key header 鉴权(备选方式)
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/projects
X-Key: {{secret}}

### 6.3 路径命中但方法错 → 405
DELETE http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/projects?k={{secret}}

### 6.4 路径完全不匹配 → 404
GET http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/nope

### 6.5 不存在的项目 → 404
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/projects/no-such-project/upload?k={{secret}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="sample.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 6.6 不支持的扩展名 → 400 + failed[]
POST http://{{host}}:{{port}}/api/v1/projects/{{project}}/upload?k={{secret}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="bad.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

hello
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--
